RealizeUI
=========

RealizeUI branch `16` is based on LineageOS 23.2.

Getting started
---------------

To initialize the RealizeUI source tree, use:

```
repo init -u https://github.com/RealizeUI/android.git -b 16 --git-lfs
```

Then sync the source:

```
repo sync
```

Device trees, kernels, and proprietary dependencies belong in a local
manifest or a separate device manifest. They are intentionally not included
in this ROM manifest.

RealizeUI currently replaces `LineageOS/android_vendor_lineage` with
`RealizeUI/android_vendor_lineage`. All other projects continue to track the
LineageOS `lineage-23.2` base until a RealizeUI fork is needed.
